{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026fxkCDSs8mC1795105154.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>香港公開羽毛球錦標賽，港隊的伍家朗因傷退賽，李卓耀不敵昆拉武特，十六強止步。</p><p></p><p>啡色衫的李卓耀，面對泰國的昆拉武特，開局落後過1-7，之後都未能追近，先輸14-21。</p><p></p><p>過去五次交手，世界第二的昆拉武特贏四次，李卓耀第二局領先過6-4，早段比分緊咬，但中段被拉開，昆拉武特再贏21-14，直落晉級。</p><p></p><p>背向鏡頭的另一港將伍家朗，面對印尼的烏拜迪拉，首局輸10-21，第二局中段大腿出現問題，需要到場邊接受治理。之後決定退賽，無緣八強。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T17:01:01.263488+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":214,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T15:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T14:17:16.459775+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T16:54:13.917358+00:00","content_hash":"7c9e93a01f7c808d5366cb02089dbae69630263daa7ae16901dddd3fc9976de8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T17:01:01.263488+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}